# Office furniture at 16 px/m (docs/pixel-style.md §Scale, sizes in src/sizes.json), 3/4 view.
# footPx = the base in px; it sits at the bottom of the frame and the rest above it is overhang (height).
# Variants: "kind@facing" (s = the default front, n, e, w; v = drawn on its side) or a state; theme slots
# (A B C R W U T) make one frame per wing theme.

